   "block": "cleaning.dlg23",
   "event": "ordinary_request"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "When the timer goes, you can stop and that counts. If you feel like doing more, great, but you don't have to.",
   "est_sec": 6.92,
